          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Digi Yatra Develops AI-Powered E-Passport Enrolment and Facial Verification System for International Travel",
            "articleSection": "Daily Utility",
            "abstract": "Digi Yatra Foundation has shared new details of its proposed international travel system, which includes e-passport enrolment, AI-based facial verification, and token-based identity sharing to streamline border crossings for Indian travellers. The system builds on Digi Yatra's existing domestic airport face-recognition infrastructure, extending its ambition from domestic terminals to cross-border identity management. Privacy advocates are monitoring how biometric tokens will be stored, shared, and deleted across jurisdictions.",
            "url": "https://www.medianama.com/2026/05/223-digi-yatra-e-passport-global-travel/",
            "publisher": {
              "@type": "NewsMediaOrganization",
              "name": "The AI Chronicle",
